>From art1-342.txt:

  The chance of getting an artifact from each wish depends on the
  number of artifacts already created in the game:
        ARTIFACTS   0     1     2     3    4    5    6    n
        CHANCE     100%  100%  2/3   2/4  2/5  2/6  2/7 2/n+1

(The n+1 in the formula derives from the fact that the game first
creates the artifact, then rolls to see whether it should uncreate it
again, if you're wondering how this relates to the code.)

And Unique Items, such as the Bell, don't count towards the number of
artifacts that have been generated; strictly speaking, they aren't
artifacts at all, though it's convenient to discuss them in the same
place.

